  WrittenDialogue: "Uhhhh I’m totally numb. I never want this feeling to end.\nWhy are drugs so bad when they make you feel good?\nRonald Reagan’s like fucking gay.\nDrugs are only bad if you get off them.\nAs long as you have a spare budget of like 8,000 dollars a month it’s not even that serious.\nMy theory, my theory, is all those anti-drug commercials want us to stay miserable instead of happy like me right now.\nCause when you’re miserable you wanna spend money on bullshit you don’t need.\nThey don’t want your money going to the black market, they want it going to The Gap and capitalism.\nI feel so fucking smart right now. I’m gonna come here every night."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
